@base = http://127.0.0.1:43823

### OpenAPI
GET {{base}}/api-docs/v4/swagger.json

### Public activity (one-hour window, initially empty in the restored backup)
GET {{base}}/api/v4/live/history?limit=20

### Poll activity after the last returned event sequence
GET {{base}}/api/v4/live/history?after_sequence=0&limit=20

### Public activity for one artist (filter before limit)
GET {{base}}/api/v4/live/history?artist_ids=artist_3qmp7zjbg1rpebhtyfy43096vj&limit=1

### Public activity for selected artists (repeat the query key)
GET {{base}}/api/v4/live/history?artist_ids=artist_3qmp7zjbg1rpebhtyfy43096vj&artist_ids=artist_6aaf982021nrst0m68ew1djerc&limit=20

